   "text": "He headed an Islamist movement, Muhammadan Union (Ittihad-i Muhammadi in Ottoman Turkish), which was founded by him on 5 April 1908 and was one of the major critics of the Committee of Union and Progress.",
   "words": 36,
   "authors": [
    "Editor 1",
    "Editor 3"
   ],
   "author_words": [
    35,
    1
