    "in_place_since_revision": 1057564064,
    "removals": []
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "sec1-12",
   "section": "Biography",
   "text": "They demanded the annulment of the constitution, dissolution of the parliament, the expulsion of the Committee of Union and Progress members which were considered to be atheist, and the implementation of the Sharia as the constitution of the Empire.",
   "words": 39,
   "authors": [
    "Editor 1"
   ],
   "author_words": [
    39
   ],
   "author_sanctioned": false,
   "sanctioned_words": 0,
