  {
   "id": "sec1-17",
   "section": "Biography",
   "text": "However, the Committee of Union and Progress regained the power following the suppression of the revolt by the Third Army under the leadership of Mahmud Shevket Pasha, and Derviş Vahdeti was arrested in Constantinople on 18 April.",
